  "description": "Jason \"Timmy\" Ball is about as S&M as it gets. The Colorado-raised racer turned dirt jumper showed up on the Sheep Hills scene in '93 and never left. From Team Rider to Shipping Manager to Shop Manager - Balls has been holding it down for S&M in a big way for 30+ years. Second only to Moeller in tenure at The Building and embodying the ride 'em on Sunday, build 'em on Monday ethos better than anyone - it seemed fitting that our favorite punk rock, shop boss should put his signature steed into production. You can't put your arms around a memory, but you can wrap 'em around a L.A.M.F. frame.\n\nWEIGHT\n5.05 lbs. / 2.29 kgs.",
